  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a wok over medium heat. ",
    "Add the onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes. ",
    "Add the garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute. ",
    "Add the smoked paprika and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly. ",
    "Add the chilli sauce, pisto, and tomatoes, and stir to combine. ",
    "Add the bay leaves, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine. ",
    "Add the Manchego cheese and stir to combine. ",
    "Transfer the mixture to a papillote and cook for 10-12 minutes. ",
    "Garnish with parsley and serve hot.",
    "Remove the bay leaves and serve immediately.",
    "Refrigerate or freeze for later use."
  ],
